<title>USA: TVX Inc IPO postponed.</title>
<headline>TVX Inc IPO postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of TVX Inc has been postponed, according to underwriter BT Securities Corp.</p>
<p>The Golden, Colorado company had filed in February for an offering of 2.7 million shares.</p>
</text>
